        &= \beta \int_0^\infty E_v\bigl(e^{-\lambda K^s_r}\bigr)\,e^{-\beta r}\,dr\\
	   &= \frac{\beta}{\beta + \ensuremath\sqrt{2\gl} + \gamma \lambda}.	\qedhere
